<IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/profile_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Profile for Foggy"></A>  &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=private_message&u=00000031"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/priv_message.gif" BORDER='0' ALT="Send New Private Message"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=edit_post&f=1&t=000050&reply_num=000000&u=00000031"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/edit_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Edit/Delete Post"></A> &nbsp;&nbsp;<A HREF="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/cgi/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=reply&f=1&t=000050&replyto=000000"><IMG SRC="http://www.evilpumpkinracing.com/ubb/quote_ubb6.gif" BORDER="0" ALT="Reply With Quote"></A>
