<HR size="1" color="#5d7790">
<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Shadow Knight - Dual wield isn't that big of a deal, just use good 2H weapons<P>Monk - fun class, another tank class like warrior (lower AC and HP), but very soloable.  Mend - 25% instant heal (every 6 minutes) and Feign Death - (clears agro) are the two solo-enabling skills.<P>Cleric - easily soloable up to the 50's.  There is stuff to solo in the 50's but it gets real tough.<P>Wizard - soloable, often not wanted in groups unless they're needed for a specific situation, or unless there is both an enchanter and bard in the group to keep the Wizard fed with mana.<P>Necro - even less welcome in groups then Wizard, but a fun class to solo.  My necro can earn some big money, and basically has paid for all the uber equipment for all my other characters.  Not a bad choice at all (Iksar necros get forage and regen, which are just awesome skills to have)
</FONT>
